---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<section
  class="section-hero bg-gray-50 py-10 lg:py-20 bg-no-repeat bg-cover relative overflow-hidden z-0"
>
  <Image
    src="/img/bg/1.png"
    alt=""
    width={1200}
    height={600}
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    format="webp"
    quality={45}
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top -z-10"
  />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/80 dark:bg-black/80 md:bg-transparent -z-10"></div>
  <div class="container z-10">
    <div class="sm:max-w-md md:max-w-xl text-center sm:text-left">
  <p class="text-sm mb-1 text-main font-semibold">
    🚛 Layanan Sedot WC Profesional • Siap 24 Jam
  </p>

  <h1>Jasa Sedot WC Tangerang Respon Cepat 24 Jam</h1>

  <p>
    Melayani sedot WC, sedot septic tank, saluran mampet, dan pembersihan limbah
    untuk rumah, ruko, kantor, restoran, apartemen, hingga kawasan industri di
    Tangerang dan sekitarnya.
  </p>

  <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
    <li>✅ Respon Cepat</li>
    <li>✅ Teknisi Berpengalaman</li>
    <li>✅ Harga Transparan</li>
